{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qhES4XKOwD1795614932.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名男子在清水灣道、大坳門路交界被捲入小巴車底死亡。現場消息指，他是該小巴的司機，懷疑徒手想阻止小巴溜前不果被撞倒。</p><p></p><p>涉事小巴事後停在路邊，見到地上有血漬，車底有相信是死者穿的鞋。</p><p></p><p>警方稱傍晚六時半接報，一名男子被捲入一輛綠色小巴車底，送院後不治。現場消息指，他是該小巴的司機，因事下車時，懷疑見到小巴溜前，徒手阻止失敗，當時車上無乘客。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T14:45:44.247681+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T12:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T00:51:15.595417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:37:17.594347+00:00","content_hash":"dea92dc8312ace6797f8b61ceb1ef05f150c9fd9a27dd8e913c1ec19ea266bec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T14:45:44.247681+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}